    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "497c8872-d618-4020-9165-cfe9ff9f9b60",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Phantom Duck",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121031436555",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 424a5acc-8897-40f8-87cf-fb62e6323cab).Image",
        "Description": "Now do you remember? Who you are? What you were meant to do? I cheated death, thanks to you. And thanks to you, I&apos;ve left my mark. you have too - you&apos;ve written your own history. You&apos;re your own man. I&apos;m 47, and you are, too... No, he&apos;s the two of us. Together. Where we are, today? We built it. This story - this &quot;legend&quot; - it&apos;s ours. We can change the world - and with it, the future. I am you, and you are me. Carry that with you, wherever you go. Thank you my friend. From here on out, you&apos;re 47.",
